From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 08:55:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix social playback lag by shipping constant-frame-rate
 libx264 masters

Shorts were encoded with Apple VideoToolbox and no fps filter, which writes
VFR timestamps. YouTube/TikTok/IG then stutter the picture while AAC audio
plays cleanly. Delivery now uses libx264 CFR, existing masters can be
remastered without changing audio, and Studio Replace updates the original
video ids so view counts are not reset.
